Other dependencies
------------------

Everything else is installed from npm or PyPI rather than vendored into this
repository, and remains under its own licence. The direct dependencies are
listed in frontend/package.json and backend/requirements.txt. Headless UI and
Tailwind CSS, which the components above build on, are both MIT licensed.

The dataset in data/ is the IBM sample Telco Customer Churn dataset, widely
redistributed for educational use and bundled here as the assessment brief
instructs.
